{"type":"TEXT","ticket":55659,"id":"82a5fa93504840f1"}||{"x":80,"y":1300,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"电路解析｜工具自身供电","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":55660,"id":"0321e415c7c24993"}||{"x":80,"y":1268,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"DC 与 Type-C 均接外部 5V，使用时人工二选一。\nD1 / D2 为 SS34 肖特基二极管：\n阳极 A 接各自入口，阴极 K 汇合至 LDO_VIN。\n二极管阻断反灌；输入电容储能，4.7kΩ用于泄放。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":55661,"id":"13b780488ee54db9"}||{"x":650,"y":880,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"电路解析｜Type-C 的作用","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":55662,"id":"c7cb32006b894094"}||{"x":650,"y":848,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:CC1/CC2各5.1kΩ下拉；只用5V，不做PD升压。\nA7/B7=USB_DM，A6/B6=USB_DP；支持正反插。\nD5为双路USB静电保护，数据跨页接GPIO19/20。\nType-C兼作供电、下载、日志和命令交互。\n接电脑时不接DC；DC供电时通过Wi-Fi使用。\n电脑USB供电能力和Wi-Fi瞬态须样机核验。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":55663,"id":"cdbd8cf9323b450a"}||{"x":1510,"y":1300,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"电路解析｜LDO 与热量","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":55664,"id":"98983afbd49a4361"}||{"x":1510,"y":1268,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:U3采用ME6211A33PG-N（C236673），输出3.3V，标称500mA。\n引脚：1=公共地，2=LDO_VIN，3=TOOL_3V3。\nC3/C4均为10µF/16V/X7R陶瓷电容，靠近输入/输出引脚。\n前级SS34保留；0.75A为历史预留点，不是当前供电能力。\n实际Wi-Fi瞬态、输出稳定性和温升须样机验证。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":55665,"id":"a49b2c6dbc0743f9"}||{"x":80,"y":800,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"接线边界","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":55666,"id":"f2ec363a7797440f"}||{"x":80,"y":768,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:本页电源只供工具自身；外部模拟电源和充电器另接。\nType-C兼作供电、固件下载、日志与命令交互；DC/USB人工二选一。\n工具5V、充电器正端、电池正端不得混接；系统公共地按图连接。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
